{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Felt Mansion",
    "steam_appid": 3703690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Felt Mansion</i> is a 2D-fangame Adventure mainly focused on boss fights and exploration based on the <i>Homestuck</i> universe by Andrew Hussie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a huge and mysterious mansion as the 4 Beta Kids, and fight your way through a gangster organization to save the young Handmaid from the clutches of the fearsome Doc Scratch.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world entirely based on the <i>Homestuck</i> universe, from the characters to the soundtracks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-real time battle system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with their own original combat mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five zones to explore forming a complex and intricate mansion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clocks (A lot...)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 15 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powers and abilities unlocked as the adventure unfolds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consorts everywhere: shopkeepers, quest givers...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive equipment system allowing various different builds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devilish puzzles, left everywhere by the cunning Doc Scratch</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NewGame+ mode to test your skills while enjoying a different game experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Felt Mansion</i> is a 2D-fangame Adventure mainly focused on boss fights and exploration based on the <i>Homestuck</i> universe by Andrew Hussie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a huge and mysterious mansion as the 4 Beta Kids, and fight your way through a gangster organization to save the young Handmaid from the clutches of the fearsome Doc Scratch.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world entirely based on the <i>Homestuck</i> universe, from the characters to the soundtracks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-real time battle system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with their own original combat mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five zones to explore forming a complex and intricate mansion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clocks (A lot...)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 15 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powers and abilities unlocked as the adventure unfolds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consorts everywhere: shopkeepers, quest givers...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive equipment system allowing various different builds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devilish puzzles, left everywhere by the cunning Doc Scratch</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NewGame+ mode to test your skills while enjoying a different game experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Felt Mansion is an Adventure/Action RPG fan-game set in the world of Andrew Hussie's Homestuck. Save the young Handmaid from the clutches of the fearsome Doc Scratch!",
